---
// The Docker Compose deployment: Traefik in front, interface and server behind, labs as sibling containers.
---

<figure class="diagram">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 880 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="dd-title dd-desc">
		<title id="dd-title">Docker deployment</title>
		<desc id="dd-desc">
			Browsers connect to Traefik on port 443. Traefik routes the root path to the interface on port 8100, and /api and
			/socket.io to the Antimony server on port 3000. The server stores data in PostgreSQL and starts lab containers
			through the Docker socket with containerlab. SSH clients connect to the server's SSH port directly.
		</desc>
		<defs>
			<marker id="dd-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow" />
			</marker>
			<marker id="dd-aa" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-accent" />
			</marker>
			<marker id="dd-aw" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-warm" />
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<!-- Users -->
		<rect x="20" y="70" width="150" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="36" y="96" class="t">Browser</text>
		<text x="36" y="116" class="t-mono">https://host</text>
		<rect x="20" y="300" width="150" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="36" y="326" class="t">SSH / Wireshark</text>
		<text x="36" y="346" class="t-mono">ssh -p 6969</text>

		<!-- Host -->
		<rect x="210" y="20" width="650" height="380" rx="14" class="zone" />
		<text x="226" y="44" class="t-zone">Docker host · network_mode: host</text>

		<rect x="240" y="66" width="150" height="74" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="256" y="92" class="t">Traefik</text>
		<text x="256" y="112" class="t-mono">:80 → :443</text>
		<text x="256" y="128" class="t-sub">Let's Encrypt</text>
		<path d="M170 102 H236" class="edge" marker-end="url(#dd-a)" />

		<rect x="460" y="56" width="170" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="476" y="80" class="t">Interface</text>
		<text x="476" y="98" class="t-mono">:8100 · static files</text>

		<rect x="460" y="150" width="170" height="150" rx="10" class="box-accent" />
		<text x="476" y="176" class="t">Antimony server</text>
		<text x="476" y="196" class="t-mono">:3000 REST + Socket.IO</text>
		<text x="476" y="214" class="t-mono">:6969 SSH</text>
		<text x="476" y="240" class="t-sub">privileged · pid: host</text>
		<text x="476" y="256" class="t-sub">containerlab inside</text>
		<text x="476" y="282" class="t-mono">config.yml</text>

		<path d="M390 90 H456" class="edge" marker-end="url(#dd-a)" />
		<text x="396" y="82" class="t-mono">/</text>
		<path d="M390 118 C 425 118, 420 186, 456 186" class="edge" marker-end="url(#dd-a)" />
		<text x="350" y="160" class="t-mono">/api</text>
		<text x="350" y="178" class="t-mono">/socket.io</text>

		<path d="M170 332 C 320 332, 330 214, 456 214" class="edge-warm" marker-end="url(#dd-aw)" />

		<rect x="700" y="66" width="140" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="716" y="92" class="t">PostgreSQL</text>
		<text x="716" y="112" class="t-mono">:5432</text>
		<path d="M630 175 C 670 175, 670 100, 696 100" class="edge" marker-end="url(#dd-a)" />

		<rect x="680" y="196" width="160" height="110" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="696" y="220" class="t">Docker daemon</text>
		<text x="696" y="240" class="t-mono">/var/run/docker.sock</text>
		<path d="M630 240 H676" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#dd-aa)" />

		<rect x="460" y="326" width="380" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
		<text x="476" y="350" class="t">Lab containers</text>
		<text x="476" y="368" class="t-mono">clab-&lt;instance&gt;-&lt;node&gt;</text>
		<path d="M760 306 V322" class="edge" marker-end="url(#dd-a)" />
		<path d="M545 300 V322" class="edge-warm edge-dashed" marker-end="url(#dd-aw)" />
		<text x="553" y="316" class="t-sub">shells, capture</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		The default Docker Compose setup. Traefik terminates TLS and routes requests by path. The server starts lab containers next to itself through the host's Docker daemon.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
